<h2>Key Takeaway</h2>
<p><strong>Draw No Bet (DNB), Asian Handicaps (0.0, -0.25, -0.75) & GG / Over 2.5 in Naira (₦):</strong> Choose bet structures that minimize compounded overround and match your actual analytical edge rather than chasing flashy multi-leg payouts.</p>'
