<h2>Key Takeaway</h2>
<p><strong>Team-Level Regression: Expected Points vs Actual:</strong> Demand large out-of-sample evidence, respect regression to the mean, and calibrate probabilities against objective scoring rules like Brier score and CLV.</p>'
